we can inject those dependent object by using
1)Direct reference varible-creating object directly inside the class
2)Constructor injection-passing depndent object through constructor
3)setter injection-injecting dependent object using public setter method


Types of Association:
Aggregation
Weak relationship between classes.
Objects can exist independently of each other.
Example:
A Car HAS-A Music Player.
The Music Player can be removed, reused, or replaced — it can exist without the car.
Composition
Strong relationship between classes.
One object is fully dependent on the other.
Example:
A Car HAS-A Engine.
The Engine is an essential part of the car — if the car is destroyed, the engine has no real standalone meaning.
Associations can be:
One-to-One
One-to-Many
Many-to-One
Many-to-Many
*These are also known as Cardinality of Associations. Cardinality is the count or the number of connections.

